<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 379 MLN OF POLISH BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 379 MLN OF POLISH BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 15 million zlotys of one-year floating Treasury bonds against the finance ministry's 150 million offer and for 364 million zlotys of three-year T-bonds against a 350 million offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
